            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/%CE%A0-pretopos"} Π-pretopos
            with an RNO but no NNO. However, the argument works for a
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/infinitary+coherent+category"} geometric
