                %mrow
                  %mi WCC
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} WCC
            (
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/weak+countable+choice"}> weak countable choice
            ) to prove that it is an RNO.
          %p
            Note that any
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Boolean+topos"} Boolean topos
            with an NNO satisfies
            = succeed "," do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi WCC
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} WCC
